  "name": "pr-sweep",
  "description": "Sweep open (or listed) PRs with up to 100 parallel agents: security-scan outside contributors, rebase onto main when behind (push --force-with-lease), approve pending first-time-contributor CI when relevant, optionally rebase in-house PRs, and report who should review. Supports full, changed-only, behind-only, and conflict-only scopes for cheap daily runs. Use when the user runs /pr-sweep (or /pr-inbound-sweep), or asks to \"sweep PRs\", \"sweep inbound PRs\", \"security-check outside PRs\", \"rebase outsider PRs\", \"rebase our PRs\", \"approve waiting CI on PRs\", \"daily PR sweep\", or \"prep external PRs for review\".",
